{
  "about": [
    "0.0.27 P13 ID-VIS-PROOF — the AC → test → code trace (`Trace`, version `proof.TRACE_VERSION`).",
    "Vocabulary (P46 switches on these): AC status proven | green-not-tdd | red | unrun | untested;",
    "test tdd proven | green-only | red | unrecorded (basis timed: red_at < green_at is the proof; sets: a record from before timed history); code coverage covered | untested | unknown | pending;",
    "THE RULE: a test is identified by its FULL id path::Class::name (the node `id` is test:<that id>); only a full id whose file git tracks in the tree being judged (not ignored; at head for a range) and whose AST binds that qualified key EXACTLY ONCE can prove. A bare id never proves; a class the file does not hold, or a method named without its class, is unlocated; a name the file binds more than once makes a qualifier-less id ambiguous. Every other case is a non-proving `state` with its `reason`: ambiguous | unlocated | unparsed (file does not parse / has no outline) | ignored (gitignored / untracked at head) | deleted (git shows removal) — carried as `tdd` too, counted in risk.tests_non_proving;",
    "a parametrised id (test_x[case]) maps to its base test: `params` lists the params recorded; proven only when every param that ran is proven, red when any is;",
    "a test's tdd state is its LATEST outcome; proven = EVERY recorded id and spelling of its full id (tests\\t.py, ./tests/t.py are one) has first outcome red, red_at < green_at, latest green; red when any id's latest is red; ids of different qualifiers never merge;",
    "gates: verdict unknown when a row says neither way; `attached` run | time-window (a Karpathy/spec row naming no run, inside the run's window); the ledger read has no cap;",
    "a commit range is judged at `head`: when the working tree is not `head` for a changed or test path, coverage is unknown and graph.note says why;",
    "gate verdict red | skipped | passed; edge kind tested-by (AC→test) | exercises (test→code) | anchors (AC→code);",
    "edge basis recorded | planned (from the run's test record) · structural | lexical (from the graph) · anchor (the spec).",
    "Paged by rows (ACs, then code no AC reaches): `page.next` continues; `draw` says when the picture is reduced."
  ],
  "schemas": {
    "ProofTarget": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["kind", "run", "session", "base", "head", "title", "basis"],
      "properties": {
        "kind": {"type": "string", "enum": ["run", "session", "range", "live"]},
        "run": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "session": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
        "base": {"type": "string"}, "head": {"type": "string"},
        "title": {"type": "string"}, "basis": {"type": "string"}}},
    "ProofFile": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["path", "status", "added", "removed", "too_large", "binary", "lines", "hunks", "is_test"],
      "properties": {
        "path": {"type": "string"}, "status": {"type": "string"},
        "added": {"type": "integer"}, "removed": {"type": "integer"},
        "too_large": {"type": "boolean"}, "binary": {"type": "boolean"},
        "lines": {"type": "string"}, "hunks": {"type": "integer"}, "is_test": {"type": "boolean"}}},
    "ProofAC": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "ac", "text", "kind", "tests", "code", "anchors", "status", "risk", "proven_by", "note"],
      "properties": {
        "id": {"type": "string"}, "ac": {"type": "string"}, "text": {"type": "string"},
        "kind": {"type": "string"},
        "tests": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "code": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "anchors": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["file", "symbol", "kind", "source"],
                    "properties": {"file": {"type": "string"}, "symbol": {"type": "string"},
                                   "kind": {"type": "string"}, "source": {"type": "string"}}}},
        "status": {"type": "string", "enum": ["proven", "green-not-tdd", "red", "unrun", "untested", "ambiguous"]},
        "risk": {"type": "integer"},
        "proven_by": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "note": {"type": "string"}}},
    "ProofTest": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "label", "path", "line", "symbol", "located", "changed", "recorded_ids",
                   "acs", "code", "tdd", "red_at", "green_at", "last", "last_at", "basis", "ambiguous", "state",
                   "reason", "params", "qualifier", "tdd_note", "qualified_from"],
      "properties": {
        "id": {"type": "string"}, "label": {"type": "string"}, "path": {"type": "string"},
        "line": {"type": "integer"}, "symbol": {"type": "string"},
        "located": {"type": "boolean"}, "changed": {"type": "boolean"},
        "recorded_ids": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "acs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "code": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "tdd": {"type": "string", "enum": ["proven", "green-only", "red", "unrecorded", "deleted", "ambiguous", "unlocated", "unparsed", "ignored"]},
        "red_at": {"type": ["number", "null"]}, "green_at": {"type": ["number", "null"]},
        "last": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "last_at": {"type": ["number", "null"]},
        "basis": {"type": "string", "enum": ["timed", "sets", "none"]},
        "ambiguous": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "state": {"type": "string", "enum": ["present", "deleted", "ambiguous", "unlocated", "unparsed", "ignored"]},
        "reason": {"type": "string"},
        "params": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "qualifier": {"type": "string"},
        "tdd_note": {"type": "string"},
        "qualified_from": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}}},
    "ProofCode": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "label", "path", "symbol", "kind", "line", "changed", "status", "added",
                   "removed", "coverage", "fan_in", "blast", "blast_cut", "full_available", "basis",
                   "tests", "acs", "approvals", "note", "risk"],
      "properties": {
        "id": {"type": "string"}, "label": {"type": "string"}, "path": {"type": "string"},
        "symbol": {"type": "string"}, "kind": {"type": "string"}, "line": {"type": "integer"},
        "changed": {"type": "boolean"}, "status": {"type": "string"},
        "added": {"type": "integer"}, "removed": {"type": "integer"},
        "coverage": {"type": "string", "enum": ["covered", "untested", "unknown", "pending", "test"]},
        "fan_in": {"type": "integer"}, "blast": {"type": "integer"},
        "blast_cut": {"type": "boolean"}, "full_available": {"type": "boolean"},
        "basis": {"type": "string"},
        "tests": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "acs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "approvals": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object",
                      "required": ["decision", "actor", "at", "proposal"],
                      "properties": {"decision": {"type": "string"}, "actor": {"type": "string"},
                                     "at": {"type": "string"}, "proposal": {"type": "string"}}}},
        "note": {"type": "string"}, "risk": {"type": "integer"}}},
    "ProofEdge": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["source", "target", "kind", "basis", "site"],
      "properties": {
        "source": {"type": "string"}, "target": {"type": "string"},
        "kind": {"type": "string", "enum": ["tested-by", "exercises", "anchors"]},
        "basis": {"type": "string", "enum": ["recorded", "planned", "structural", "lexical", "anchor"]},
        "site": {"type": "string"}}},
    "ProofGate": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["gate", "verdict", "at", "path", "detail", "source", "attached"],
      "properties": {
        "gate": {"type": "string"},
        "verdict": {"type": "string", "enum": ["red", "skipped", "passed", "unknown"]},
        "at": {"type": "string"}, "path": {"type": "string"}, "detail": {"type": "string"},
        "source": {"type": "string"},
        "attached": {"type": "string", "enum": ["run", "time-window"]}}},
    "ProofApproval": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["proposal", "decision", "target", "actor", "at", "tool"],
      "properties": {
        "proposal": {"type": "string"}, "decision": {"type": "string"}, "target": {"type": "string"},
        "actor": {"type": "string"}, "at": {"type": "string"}, "tool": {"type": "string"}}},
    "ProofRisk": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["untested_acs", "red_acs", "tests_not_tdd_proven", "tests_ambiguous", "tests_deleted",
                   "tests_non_proving", "code_without_test", "code_coverage_unknown", "gates_red", "gates_skipped", "gates_unknown",
                   "blast", "graph_basis", "score"],
      "properties": {
        "untested_acs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "red_acs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "tests_not_tdd_proven": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "tests_ambiguous": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "tests_deleted": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "tests_non_proving": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "code_without_test": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "code_coverage_unknown": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
        "gates_red": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofGate"}},
        "gates_skipped": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofGate"}},
        "gates_unknown": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofGate"}},
        "blast": {"type": "object", "required": ["fan_in_total", "cut", "top"],
                  "properties": {"fan_in_total": {"type": "integer"}, "cut": {"type": "integer"},
                                 "top": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object",
                                         "required": ["id", "fan_in", "risk", "coverage"],
                                         "properties": {"id": {"type": "string"}, "fan_in": {"type": "integer"},
                                                        "risk": {"type": "integer"}, "coverage": {"type": "string"}}}}}},
        "graph_basis": {"type": "string"}, "score": {"type": "integer"}}},
    "Trace": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["sample", "version", "target", "files", "nodes", "edges", "gates", "approvals",
                   "risk", "record", "graph", "page", "draw", "note"],
      "properties": {
        "sample": {"type": "boolean"}, "version": {"type": "integer"},
        "target": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofTarget"},
        "files": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofFile"}},
        "nodes": {"type": "object", "required": ["acs", "tests", "code"],
                  "properties": {"acs": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofAC"}},
                                 "tests": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofTest"}},
                                 "code": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofCode"}}}},
        "edges": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofEdge"}},
        "gates": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofGate"}},
        "approvals": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofApproval"}},
        "risk": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofRisk"},
        "record": {"type": "object", "required": ["last_suite", "red", "green", "timed", "recorded_acs", "planned_acs"],
                   "properties": {"last_suite": {"type": ["object", "null"]}, "red": {"type": "integer"},
                                  "green": {"type": "integer"}, "timed": {"type": "integer"},
                                  "recorded_acs": {"type": "integer"}, "planned_acs": {"type": "integer"}}},
        "graph": {"type": "object", "required": ["basis", "backend", "bases", "note"],
                  "properties": {"basis": {"type": "string"}, "backend": {"type": "string"},
                                 "bases": {"type": "object"}, "note": {"type": "string"}}},
        "page": {"type": "object", "required": ["n", "size", "rows", "total_rows", "total_acs", "total_tests", "total_code", "next"],
                 "properties": {"n": {"type": "integer"}, "size": {"type": "integer"}, "rows": {"type": "integer"},
                                "total_rows": {"type": "integer"}, "total_acs": {"type": "integer"},
                                "total_tests": {"type": "integer"}, "total_code": {"type": "integer"},
                                "next": {"type": ["integer", "null"]}}},
        "draw": {"type": "object", "required": ["limit", "total", "reduced", "note", "shown"],
                 "properties": {"limit": {"type": "integer"}, "total": {"type": "integer"},
                                "reduced": {"type": "boolean"}, "note": {"type": "string"},
                                "shown": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}}},
        "note": {"type": "string"}}},
    "ProofTargets": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["sample", "initialized", "git", "focus", "runs", "sessions", "default", "note"],
      "properties": {
        "sample": {"type": "boolean"}, "initialized": {"type": "boolean"}, "git": {"type": "boolean"},
        "focus": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
        "runs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["run", "acs", "sessions", "note"],
                 "properties": {"run": {"type": "string"}, "acs": {"type": "integer"},
                                "sessions": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
                                "note": {"type": "string"}}}},
        "sessions": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["session", "run", "files", "writes"],
                     "properties": {"session": {"type": "string"}, "run": {"type": "string"},
                                    "files": {"type": "integer"}, "writes": {"type": "integer"}}}},
        "default": {"type": ["object", "null"]}, "note": {"type": "string"}}}
  },
  "routes": [
    {
      "path": "/api/proof", "method": "GET", "kind": "json",
      "params": {"query": {
        "run": "a run id (its spec's ACs, its test record, its gates); optional with session/base+head",
        "session": "a session id — its worktree diff is the change set (its bound run supplies the ACs)",
        "base": "with head: a commit range base...head is the change set",
        "head": "with base",
        "live": "1: the working tree against HEAD (uncommitted + untracked) is the change set",
        "page": "page of rows (ACs, then code no AC reaches), default 1",
        "size": "rows per page, default 200, at most 2000",
        "sync_ms": "how long to wait before answering the job's handle (202)",
        "job": "a job id the page waited for — its finished answer"}},
      "responses": {
        "200": {"media": "json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/schemas/Trace"}},
        "400": {"media": "json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/schemas/Error"}}
      },
      "probes": [
        {"query": {"session": "S-1", "sync_ms": "20000"}, "status": 200},
        {"query": {"base": "HEAD", "head": "HEAD", "sync_ms": "20000"}, "status": 200},
        {"query": {"live": "1", "sync_ms": "20000"}, "status": 200},
        {"query": {"run": "run-parser-fix"}, "status": 200, "demo": true},
        {"query": {}, "status": 400},
        {"query": {"base": "HEAD"}, "status": 400},
        {"query": {"session": "S-1", "live": "1"}, "status": 400},
        {"query": {"run": "../etc"}, "status": 400},
        {"query": {"run": "no-such-run"}, "status": 400},
        {"query": {"session": "S-1", "page": "0"}, "status": 400}
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "/api/proof/targets", "method": "GET", "kind": "json",
      "params": {},
      "responses": {"200": {"media": "json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/schemas/ProofTargets"}}},
      "probes": [{"status": 200}, {"status": 200, "demo": true}]
    }
  ]
}
